UID:mJ2aDJCMihl1IqlI2RbHJ
SUMMARY:Japan Junction
DTSTAMP:20260805T053738Z
DTSTART:20260805T163000Z
DESCRIPTION:August 10: “Urashima Taro” and Moving Sea Turtle \nAugust bring
	s hot summer days to both Houston and Japan\, making it the perfect time t
	o visit the seaside! Join us as we journey beneath the waves with one of J
	apan’s most beloved folktales\, “Urashima Taro.” When the kind-hearted Ura
	shima Taro rescues a sea turtle\, he is swept away on an unforgettable und
	erwater adventure filled with wonder and magic. \nAfter the kamishibai sto
	rytelling\, you can create your own Rocking Sea Turtle featuring Urashima 
	Taro riding atop his sea turtle companion. Dive into the world of Japanese
	 folklore and celebrate the joys of summer through storytelling and hands-
	on creativity!\n\nhttps://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/japan-junction-3-
	2-2-2-2/2026-08-05/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/japan-junction-3-2-2-2-2/2026-08
	-05/
LOCATION:Levy Park (Event Pavilion)\, TX
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
